le gear and extra power of the later RG. Sonny graciously granted me permission to deviate from his non-modification license and to base my RG upon his B model. I deeply appreciate this and stress that credit for the foundation airframe and its modeling belong to Sonny; his is really well done. I encourage you to fly his plane as well.","topics":[],"score":173255,"global_rank":418845},{"name":"SBALDOCK/code201-lab5","owner":"SBALDOCK","html_url":"https://github.com/SBALDOCK/code201-lab5","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":0,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"Code201 - Lab 5 Assignment","topics":[],"score":173254,"global_rank":418846},{"name":"mijkal/dim-up-dim-down","owner":"mijkal","html_url":"https://github.com/mijkal/dim-up-dim-down","stars":0,"forks":0,"watchers":1,"issues":0,"language":"Other","description":"AppleScript to control Mac display, volume","topics":[],"score":173251,"global_rank":418847}]